KGRvSMaO-A2Q&oe=6AC4F5ED"}, {"file_name": "HighresScreenshot00001.png", "id": "996888212960021", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499622334_996888216293354_9084939939870567265_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=0BqUKugGpeYQ7kNvwEVglGI&_nc_oc=AdprUgHKELdvpoG8jtGYF0ijs7Q205A2ApU6PNDi3BU9QJolCVK9ufNo9QOxnlyQC34&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQPa06mswH2odh2AhS0OIYGW2WwJuEJoCpGObMIlygU1yQ&oe=6AC51B4C"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Global Safety Standards for EVs", "keywords": ["VR", "ImmerseLearn"], "long_description": "Global Safety Standards for EVs is an immersive VR training application designed exclusively for learners enrolled in the ImmerseLearn Global Safety Standards for EVs Micro-Credential Program.\n\nThrough realistic, interactive simulations, learners gain hands-on experience with essential EV safety practices, including hazard recognition, personal protective equipment (PPE), high-voltage safety procedures, risk assessment, emergency response protocols, and compliance with global electric vehicle safety standards.\n\nThe application allows users to practice critical safety tasks in a controlled virtual environment, helping build confidence, competence, and workplace readiness without exposure to real-world risks.\n\nImportant: This application is not intended for general public use. Access is available only to individuals who have enrolled in the ImmerseLearn Global Safety Standards for EVs Micro-Credential Program and have been authorized to use the VR training content as part of their learning experience.", "short_description": "Global Safety Standards for EVs is a VR training application developed as part of ImmerseLearn's Global Safety Standards for EVs Micro-Credential Program. This application provides immersive, hands-on training on EV safety procedures, industry standards, hazard identification, and safe work practices. Access is